# Baseline (code-first EF migration) vs UAT — Structural Diff (Task 8)

Date: 2026-06-03
Branch: feature/code-first-migrations
Method: Built the schema FROM SCRATCH on a throwaway local Postgres 16.14 container
(`slx-baseline-check`, localhost:55432, db `spacelinx_baseline`) by:
  1. `dotnet ef database update` (Baseline migration `20260603153927_Baseline`)
  2. applying `database/procedures/*` in manifest order
  3. applying `database/repeatable/views/*` in manifest order
Then `pg_dump --schema-only --no-owner --no-privileges -n mes -n sc -n common -n application -n pm`
(SAME flags/client used for `uat.schema.sql`) -> `baseline.schema.sql`.
Comparison is by SETS of structural facts (not raw text diff). Live-DB introspection
was used to confirm dump-level findings.

Legend: each delta is classified in `diff-allowlist.md` as STRUCTURAL / COSMETIC / EXPECTED.

================================================================================
